# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lead notifications (Resend).
#
# THESE ARE NOT OPTIONAL IN PRODUCTION. The audit form's disk write goes to
# .data/leads.json, and Vercel's filesystem is ephemeral — it is wiped on
# every deploy and not shared between serverless invocations. The email IS
# the storage until a database is wired up. With RESEND_API_KEY unset the
# send is skipped, the visitor still sees the thank-you page, and the lead
# is gone.
#
# RESEND_API_KEY     resend.com -> API Keys -> Create. Starts "re_".
# LEAD_NOTIFY_EMAIL  where leads land. Until you have verified a domain in
#                    Resend this MUST be the address your Resend account is
#                    registered with — their test sender refuses to deliver
#                    anywhere else.
# LEAD_FROM_EMAIL    optional. Defaults to onboarding@resend.dev, which is
#                    the only sender that works before domain verification.
#                    Point it at your own domain once you have one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RESEND_API_KEY=
LEAD_NOTIFY_EMAIL=
LEAD_FROM_EMAIL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Booking. Public: these are meant to be visible in the browser.
# With neither set, Contact falls back to WhatsApp and email.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Booking. Set ONE of these; NEXT_PUBLIC_BOOKING_URL wins if both are set.
# Full scheduler URL, any provider (Calendly, Cal.com, SavvyCal…):
NEXT_PUBLIC_BOOKING_URL=
# Or just a Cal.com handle, e.g. jigme/intro-call:
NEXT_PUBLIC_CAL_LINK=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Payments (Razorpay Subscriptions).
#
# KEY_ID is public and safe in the browser. KEY_SECRET and WEBHOOK_SECRET are
# server-only — never prefix them with NEXT_PUBLIC_, and never commit real
# values. Rotate immediately if either one leaks.
#
# Use test keys (rzp_test_...) until you have taken a full test payment.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
